{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47274","headline":"游仙二十四首 十一 · 吴筠","name":"游仙二十四首 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九龙何蜿蜿，载我升云纲。\n临睨怀旧国，风尘混苍茫。\n依依远人寰，去去迩帝乡。\n上超星辰纪，下视日月光。\n倏已过太微，天居焕煌煌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47274.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47274","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}